                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "defensive_camp",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "At dusk, the tank unit established a <w>laager</w> to refuel and carry out repairs."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Security guards stood watch around the perimeter of the armored <w>laager</w> until dawn."
                        }
